full_judgment:
(a) A decree be passed against defendant No. 1 that the cancellation of the Master LC No. IC 006096U dated 28-6-2004 as amended on 7-7-2004 is illegal, void, inoperative and not binding upon him. 

 (b) A decree be passed against defendant Nos. 1-7 for an amount of US$ 5,20,708.20 equivalent to BD Taka 3,12,42,492 in favour of him and against defendant Nos. 1-7; 

 (c) A decree be passed against defendant Nos. 1-7 for compensation of US$ 40,000 equivalent to BD Taka 24,00,000 in favour of him as on 30-10-2004 and subsequent compensation till realization of decreetal amount; 

 (d) A decree for permanent injunction be passed against defendant Nos. 8 and 9 restraining them from making the payment of the schedule 'B' import bills of defendant Nos. 3-7 till realization of his detrital amount; 

 (e) All cost of the suit be decreed against defendant Nos. 1-7 and in favour of him;
